WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.970
On the left, a robot vacuum
glides round a living room,

2
00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:06.070
turning at every wall.

3
00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:11.090
On the right, a remote-control car,
steered by a child with a handset.

4
00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:12.510
Both have wheels.

5
00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:14.010
Both have motors.

6
00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:16.610
Both are packed with electronics.

7
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:18.750
So which one is the robot?

8
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:21.210
Or are they both robots?

9
00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:24.250
In this mission, you'll
find out what robotics is,

10
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.610
and why a robot does not
have to look like a person.

11
00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:30.410
You'll learn the three
characteristics of a robot:

12
00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:33.310
a mechanical structure,
electrical components,

13
00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:34.910
and being programmable.

14
00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:40.250
And you'll see the roles robots play,
from factories and farms to hospitals.

15
00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:44.000
Your mission: decide which
one is the robot, and why.
